+|---|---|---|
+| direct-home compare in compare-replay | **1.0051** | `hash_table` +11.3%, `double_reduction` +9.5%, `arith_loop` +1.2%, `nbody` +1.2% |
+| self-loop latch absorption | **1.0036** | `double_reduction` +13.7%, `arith_loop` +11.7%, `loop_patterns` +1.1% |
